### Testing Enhanced Medicine Filtering API

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy

### 1. Basic Search (Original functionality - should still work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?query=paracetamol&page=1&limit=10

### 2. Search by Name only
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?name=aspirin&page=1&limit=10

### 3. Search by Generic Name only
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=acetaminophen&page=1&limit=10

### 4. Filter by Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=100&page=1&limit=10

### 5. Filter by Stock Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?stockMin=10&stockMax=500&page=1&limit=10

### 6. Filter by Created Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10

### 7. Combined Filtering (Name + Price Range + Stock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?name=vitamin&priceMin=5&priceMax=50&stockMin=20&page=1&limit=10

### 8. Filter with Sorting - Sort by Price (Ascending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 9. Filter with Sorting - Sort by Stock (Descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?sortBy=stock&sortOrder=desc&page=1&limit=10

### 10. Complex Filter with All Options
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?query=anti&category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&stockMin=10&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=15

### 11. Filter by Category only
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&page=1&limit=10

### 12. Search with Pagination (Larger dataset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?query=medicine&page=2&limit=20

